dy starting to see  that large companies facebook microsoft  are buying huge memberships to  organizations like we work  and so i could imagine i could imagine a  skyscraper  filled with large companies that are  overflow offices because it's  it's it's a better way for them to  maintain these these open work spaces  for people to come and go as they please  um but i i do not think it's the end of  the office  because human beings crave each other so  much and as we've all learned we miss  our friends and we miss our colleagues  [Music]  you
 

